# Real Estate Lead Generator — v4.0

## Full System Flow

```
Customer Chat (Chatbot)
        │
        │  "I'm looking for a 3 bedroom house in Colombo to rent"
        │
        ▼
  Extract Keywords
  tag_list = ["3bedroomhouse", "colombo", "houseforrent", "propertysrilanka"]
        │
        ▼
POST /scrape
{
  "tag_list": ["3bedroomhouse", "colombo", "houseforrent"],
  "social_media": { "facebook": true, "instagram": true, "tiktok": true }
}
        │
        ├──► TikTok Hashtag Scraper  ─┐
        │    clockworks/tiktok-hashtag │  hashtags = tag_list
        │                             │
        ├──► TikTok Main Scraper  ────┤  hashtags = tag_list
        │    clockworks/tiktok-scraper│
        │                             │
        ├──► Instagram Scraper  ──────┤  directUrls = /explore/tags/<tag>/
        │    apify/instagram-scraper  │  resultsType = "details"
        │                             │
        ├──► Instagram Hashtag  ──────┤  hashtags = tag_list
        │    apify/instagram-hashtag  │  resultsType = "details"
        │                             │
        ├──► Facebook Posts  ─────────┤  fixed real-estate pages
        │    apify/facebook-posts     │  includeAbout = true
        │                             │
        └──► Facebook Hashtag  ───────┘  keywordList = tag_list
             apify/facebook-hashtag
                    │
                    ▼
          Normalize + Save to DB
                    │
                    ▼
Response:
{
  "post_links": {
    "facebook":  ["https://facebook.com/...", ...],
    "instagram": ["https://instagram.com/p/...", ...],
    "tiktok":    ["https://tiktok.com/@.../video/...", ...]
  },
  "leads_saved":   { "facebook": 12, "instagram": 8, "tiktok": 15 },
  "total_saved":   35,
  "tags_used":     ["3bedroomhouse", "colombo", "houseforrent"],
  "duration_seconds": 142.5
}
        │
        ▼
 Real Estate Team follows up with the people at those URLs
```

---

## Project Files

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `api.py` | FastAPI — POST /scrape is the main chatbot endpoint |
| `config.py` | API token, actor IDs, default hashtags, seed URLs |
| `db.py` | SQLite helpers — save/query leads |
| `normalize_lead.py` | Convert raw Apify items → standard lead dict |
| `fetch_tiktok.py` | TikTok actors — receives tag_list, returns URLs |
| `fetch_instagram.py` | Instagram actors — receives tag_list, returns URLs |
| `fetch_facebook.py` | Facebook actors — receives tag_list, returns URLs |
| `main.py` | CLI runner (uses default hashtags from config.py) |
| `export_leads.py` | Export DB → CSV |
| `actor_configs.json` | Reference JSON configs for all 6 Apify actors |

---

## Setup

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

## Start API

```bash
uvicorn api:app --reload --port 8000
```

Interactive docs → http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs

---

## API Endpoints

| Method | Path | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| **POST** | **/scrape** | **Main endpoint — called by chatbot** |
| GET | /leads | List collected leads |
| GET | /leads/export | Download as CSV |
| GET | /leads/{id} | Single lead |
| DELETE | /leads/{id} | Remove lead |
| GET | /stats | Platform breakdown + coverage |
| GET | /scrape/status | Last scrape result |

---

## POST /scrape — Request & Response

**Request:**
```json
{
  "tag_list": ["houseforrent", "colombo", "3bedroom"],
  "social_media": {
    "facebook":  true,
    "instagram": true,
    "tiktok":    true
  }
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "post_links": {
    "facebook":  ["https://www.facebook.com/someone/posts/123", "..."],
    "instagram": ["https://www.instagram.com/p/abc123/", "https://www.instagram.com/realtorname/"],
    "tiktok":    ["https://www.tiktok.com/@user/video/456", "https://www.tiktok.com/@user"]
  },
  "leads_saved":      { "facebook": 8, "instagram": 12, "tiktok": 10 },
  "total_saved":      30,
  "tags_used":        ["houseforrent", "colombo", "3bedroom"],
  "duration_seconds": 138.4
}
```

---

## How tag_list flows into each actor

| Actor | How tag_list is used |
|-------|---------------------|
| TikTok Hashtag Scraper | `hashtags = tag_list` |
| TikTok Main Scraper | `hashtags = tag_list` |
| Instagram Scraper | `directUrls = [instagram.com/explore/tags/<tag>/ for tag in tag_list]` |
| Instagram Hashtag Scraper | `hashtags = tag_list` |
| Facebook Posts Scraper | Fixed page URLs (tag_list not used — gets about/email/website from pages) |
| Facebook Hashtag Scraper | `keywordList = tag_list` |

---

## Customising seed pages / default tags

Edit `config.py`:
- `HASHTAGS` — default list used when running `main.py` directly
- `FACEBOOK_SEED_URLS` — pages the Facebook posts scraper targets
- `RESULTS_LIMIT` — max results per actor run